   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2019-07-23",
   "text": "Open and Responsive Government Act of 2019\n This bill limits the extent to which federal agencies may exempt information from requests to disclose agency records under the Freedom of Information Act, including prohibiting the withholding of a portion of an otherwise responsive record on the basis that the portion is nonresponsive."
  }
